													"locale": "en",
													"text": "<font size=\"2\" color=\"blue\">This view demonstrates the usage of a DropdownSelection in combination with expression columns.</font>\n<br>\n<font size=\"2\" color=\"blue\">A DropdownSelection uses the first column of the respective Overview Model for its labels. To display the values of multiple columns, they can be combined in an expression.</font>"
